  "description": "Typed, versioned, provider-neutral Access Projection contract surface (W041, in-package full surface): projection policies as sealed data (role/task-class x object-class bindings with allowed actions, minimum-necessary field allowlists, evidence/commercial/supplier scope filters and redaction rules), the two-stage evaluation over W009 decisions and canonical W036 records, authorized projections with typed redaction markers and stable object identity, the content-addressed audit trail with the evaluation-key replay discipline, and the access-projection:* event vocabulary over the W010 event shapes. JSON Schema projection under schemas/; runtime validators in @epoch/access-projection.",
